  "loc": "Abstract; Section 1 Introduction, p.1-2",
  "quote": "We present a model of truthful elicitation which generalizes and extends mechanisms",
  "note": "Single-agent truthful elicitation (scoring rules, single-agent mechanisms, property elicitation) via convex analysis. It does not aggregate several agents' inputs into a collective decision by voting. Multi-agent mechanism design is only treated agent by agent, with the others' reports fixed."
